 "words_heard": 215,
 "words": 218,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Some trust in chariots and some in horses",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.42,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They lean on steel and speed on the roads",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We call on the name of the LORD our God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We put our faith in his endless loads",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He answers from his holy heaven high",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With the saving power of his right hand",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.11,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now I know that the LORD saves his anointed one",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.26,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He holds us when the days are bad",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.07,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They are brought to their knees and fall",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.33,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But we rise up and stand firm",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May the LORD fulfill every request you make",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.19,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We shout for joy in the name of the Lord",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May he give you what your heart desires",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And bring all your plans to bear",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.17,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We raise our banners in the name of our God",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Looking to the one who is above us all",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They are brought to their knees and fall",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.16,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But we rise up and stand firm",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "May the LORD fulfill every request you make",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "We shout for joy in the name of the Lord",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.29,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Not in chariots nor in horses do we trust",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.35,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Only in the name of the LORD our God",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.44,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He saves the king when we cry out to him",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "His power is strong on the mountain and the road",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 1.24,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
